{"archivedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","archivedInDashboard":false,"attachedStylesheets":[],"authorName":"Shawn Peterson","categoryId":1,"contentTypeCategory":4,"createdAt":"2026-06-30T18:12:23.339Z","createdById":"26261533","currentState":"DRAFT","domain":"info.davincilabs.com","featuredImage":"","featuredImageAltText":"","htmlTitle":"Thank You for Downloading the Guide | [BRAND_TBD] Private Label","id":"216194811652","language":"en","layoutSections":{},"linkRelCanonicalUrl":"","metaDescription":"Your private label supplements guide is on the way. Check your inbox in the next few minutes.","name":"Private Label - Page - TY - Guide Download","pageRedirected":false,"publicAccessRules":[],"publicAccessRulesEnabled":false,"publishDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","published":false,"slug":"en/pl-demo-ty-guide","state":"DRAFT","subcategory":"site_page","templatePath":"Private Label/Templates/Page.html","translations":{},"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T19:27:58.426Z","updatedById":"26261533","url":"https://info.davincilabs.com/en/pl-demo-ty-guide","useFeaturedImage":false,"widgetContainers":{"main_content":{"widgets":[{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">THANK YOU</p>\n<h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Your private label guide is on the way.</h1>\n<p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Check your inbox in the next few minutes. If you don't see it, look in spam or promotions and add our email to your safe sender list.</p>\n<a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a></div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207157306,"order":0,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">While you wait, here's what to do next.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Most readers find the guide answers their biggest questions about private label supplements. A few inevitably want to discuss their specific business. If that's you, schedule a free 30-minute consultation below and we will work through your situation together.</p>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207157307,"order":1,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M4.26 10.15a23.93 23.93 0 0 1 14.66-.36c.41.12.69.5.69.93v6.91a2.62 2.62 0 0 1-1.55 2.39 23.94 23.94 0 0 0-12.94 0 2.62 2.62 0 0 1-1.55-2.39v-6.92c0-.42.27-.8.69-.93Z\"/><path d=\"M4.26 10.15A23.93 23.93 0 0 1 12 9c1.05 0 2.08.1 3.07.31M4.26 10.15c-.85.46-1.7.98-2.51 1.55a25 25 0 0 0 10.25 5.32\"/><path d=\"M18.75 11.25v-2.4l3-1.62-7.5-4.23-7.5 4.23 3 1.62v2.4\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Read the guide</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">It's designed to be read in a single afternoon. Highlight what's relevant, skip what isn't, and come back to anything you have questions about.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 19.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.24a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.07 1.92l-7.5 4.62a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.07-1.92v-.24\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Schedule a consultation</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">If the guide raises more questions than it answers, we are happy to discuss your specific business. Free 30-minute working session, no sales pitch.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M12 21a9 9 0 0 0 0-18m0 18a9 9 0 0 1 0-18m0 18c2.07 0 3.75-4.03 3.75-9S14.07 3 12 3m0 18c-2.07 0-3.75-4.03-3.75-9S9.93 3 12 3M3.6 9h16.8M3.6 15h16.8\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Browse our resource library</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">More guides, articles, and tactical content on topics from pricing to FDA compliance to brand positioning.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207157308,"order":2,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207157309,"order":3,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218949181988,"label":"PL - Global FDA Disclaimer","module_id":218942529652,"order":4,"type":"module"}]}},"widgets":{}}